# UI/Layout.lua is byte-identical in every Spoken addon and must stay that way -- the file
# says why, and pipelines/quests/tests/test_package.py is what enforces it. It loads before
# UI/Options.lua, which builds its panel with it, and both load before Events.lua, which is
# what calls SetupOptions once the world is up.
